<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OGMS_0000031> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> "In order to obtain the taxonomy of diseases / disorders / pathological process in CVDO, it is necessary to use the reasoner first and to look at the inferred class hierarchy." .
